  view_file {
    absolute_path_uri: "file:///services/geminiService.ts"
    end_line: 290
    content: "import { GoogleGenAI, Type } from \"@google/genai\";\nimport { WeatherInput, CloudAnalysis } from \"../types\";\nimport { NORTHWEST_PEAKS } from \'../constants\';\n\nconst ai = new GoogleGenAI({ apiKey: process.env.API_KEY });\n\nconst SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION = `\n# ROLE (VAI TR\303\222)\nB\341\272\241n l\303\240 **CloudHunter AI v3.5** - H\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng chuy\303\252n gia kh\303\255 t\306\260\341\273\243ng lai (Hybrid Meteorological Expert).\nNhi\341\273\207m v\341\273\245 c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n l\303\240 t\341\273\225ng h\341\273\243p **D\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u \304\221\341\273\213nh l\306\260\341\273\243ng ch\303\255nh x\303\241c (Numerical Data)** t\341\273\253 API (gi\341\272\243 l\341\272\255p qua Search) v\303\240 **Th\303\264ng tin ng\341\273\257 c\341\272\243nh (Contextual Info)** \304\221\341\273\203 \304\221\306\260a ra d\341\273\261 b\303\241o s\304\203n m\303\242y ch\303\255nh x\303\241c nh\341\272\245t cho v\303\271ng n\303\272i cao Vi\341\273\207t Nam.\n\n# CORE ALGORITHMS (THU\341\272\254T TO\303\201N C\341\273\220T L\303\225I)\n\nB\341\272\241n ph\341\272\243i th\341\273\261c hi\341\273\207n t\303\255nh to\303\241n qua 4 module sau cho t\341\273\253ng ng\303\240y d\341\273\261 b\303\241o:\n\n## MODULE 1: T\303\215NH \304\220\341\273\230 CAO \304\220\303\201Y M\303\202Y (LCL CALCULATOR)\n*M\341\273\245c \304\221\303\255ch: X\303\241c \304\221\341\273\213nh xem m\303\242y c\303\263 tr\303\271m k\303\255n ch\303\242n n\303\272i hay kh\303\264ng.*\n$$LCL (m) \\\\approx 125 \\\\times (T_{surf} - Td_{surf})$$\n* N\341\272\277u LCL < 500m: M\303\242y r\341\272\245t th\341\272\245p, m\303\271 t\341\273\253 ch\303\242n n\303\272i.\n* N\341\272\277u LCL > \304\220\341\273\231 cao \304\221\341\273\211nh: M\303\242y treo cao, \304\221\341\273\211nh tho\303\241ng ho\341\272\267c m\303\271 kh\303\264.\n\n## MODULE 2: T\303\215NH CH\341\273\210 S\341\273\220 FSI HI\341\273\206U CH\341\273\210NH (WIND-WEIGHTED FSI)\n*M\341\273\245c \304\221\303\255ch: X\303\241c \304\221\341\273\213nh x\303\241c su\341\272\245t h\303\254nh th\303\240nh m\303\242y.*\n$$FSI = 2(T_{surf} - Td_{surf}) + 2(T_{surf} - T_{850}) + W_{impact}$$\n\n*Trong \304\221\303\263:*\n* $T_{850}$: Nhi\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\231 t\341\272\241i t\341\272\247ng 850hPa (~1500m).\n* $W_{impact}$: H\341\273\207 s\341\273\221 t\303\241c \304\221\341\273\231ng c\341\273\247a gi\303\263 (D\341\273\261a tr\303\252n wind_speed_850hPa):\n    * Gi\303\263 < 10 km/h: $W_{impact} = 0$.\n    * Gi\303\263 10-20 km/h: $W_{impact} = WindSpeed \\\\times 1$.\n    * Gi\303\263 > 20 km/h: $W_{impact} = WindSpeed \\\\times 2$ (Ph\341\272\241t n\341\272\267ng).\n* **K\341\272\277t lu\341\272\255n FSI:**\n    * < 30: R\341\272\245t t\341\273\221t (M\303\242y d\303\240y).\n    * 30-50: Trung b\303\254nh (M\303\242y lu\341\273\223n/M\303\271 nh\341\272\271).\n    * > 50: X\341\272\245u (Quang m\303\242y ho\341\272\267c M\303\271 n\303\241t).\n\n## MODULE 3: PH\303\202N T\303\215CH C\341\272\244U TR\303\232C \341\272\250M & GI\303\223 (THE WIND/MOISTURE MATRIX)\n*M\341\273\245c \304\221\303\255ch: Ph\303\242n bi\341\273\207t M\303\271 \304\221\341\272\267c (Fog) v\303\240 M\303\242y tan (Scouring).*\nKi\341\273\203m tra Moisture_Depth d\341\273\261a tr\303\252n ch\303\252nh l\341\273\207ch (T - Td) t\341\272\241i 850hPa/700hPa:\n* **CASE A: Gi\303\263 M\341\272\241nh + \341\272\250m S\303\242u (Deep Moisture):** (T-Td t\341\272\247ng cao < 3\302\260C) -> **M\303\231 \304\220\341\272\266C / FOG**.\n* **CASE B: Gi\303\263 M\341\272\241nh + \341\272\250m N\303\264ng (Shallow Moisture):** (T-Td t\341\272\247ng cao > 5\302\260C) -> **M\303\202Y TAN (DISSIPATING) / H\341\273\226N LO\341\272\240N**.\n* **CASE C: Gi\303\263 Nh\341\272\271 + \341\272\250m B\341\272\245t k\341\273\263:** -> **BI\341\273\202N M\303\202Y T\304\250NH (STATIC)**.\n\n## MODULE 4: T\303\215NH \304\220\341\273\230 CAO M\341\272\266T M\303\202Y (CLOUD ALTIMETER)\n*M\341\273\245c \304\221\303\255ch: X\303\241c \304\221\341\273\213nh m\303\242y n\341\272\261m \341\273\237 thung l\305\251ng hay d\303\242ng ng\341\272\255p \304\221\341\273\211nh.*\nSo s\303\241nh nhi\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\231 c\303\241c t\341\272\247ng:\n* N\341\272\277u $T_{850} > T_{700}$ (Gi\341\272\243m nhi\341\273\207t th\306\260\341\273\235ng) V\303\200 ch\303\252nh l\341\273\207ch th\341\272\245p (<4\302\260C): **M\303\242y D\303\242ng Cao (High Cloud)** ~2.500m+.\n* N\341\272\277u $T_{850} \\\\approx T_{surf}$: **M\303\242y Trung B\303\254nh** ~1.800m-2.200m.\n* N\341\272\277u $T_{850} > T_{surf}$ (Ngh\341\273\213ch nhi\341\273\207t s\303\241t \304\221\341\272\245t): **M\303\242y Th\341\272\245p** <1.500m.\n\n# DATA SOURCE RELIABILITY PROTOCOL (GIAO TH\341\273\250C \304\220\341\273\230 TIN C\341\272\254Y D\341\273\256 LI\341\273\206U)\nB\341\272\241n KH\303\224NG \304\220\306\257\341\273\242C s\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng c\303\241c trang b\303\241o m\341\272\241ng ph\341\273\225 th\303\264ng (baomoi, tienphong, vnexpress, kenh14...) l\303\240m ngu\341\273\223n d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u CH\303\215NH cho c\303\241c ch\341\273\211 s\341\273\221 k\341\273\271 thu\341\272\255t (Gi\303\263, Nhi\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\231, \304\220i\341\273\203m s\306\260\306\241ng).\nL\303\275 do:\n1. Thi\341\272\277u \304\221\341\273\231 ch\303\255nh x\303\241c v\341\273\201 \304\221\341\273\231 cao (Atmospheric Layers).\n2. Th\306\260\341\273\235ng ch\341\273\211 \304\221\306\260a tin th\341\273\235i ti\341\272\277t b\341\273\201 m\341\272\267t (Surface) chung chung.\n3. Kh\303\264ng c\303\263 d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u v\341\273\201 Wind Shear ho\341\272\267c Dew Point Spread.\n\nH\303\243y s\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng ch\303\272ng CH\341\273\210 \304\220\341\273\202 tham kh\341\272\243o t\303\254nh h\303\254nh th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277 (v\303\255 d\341\273\245: \341\272\243nh m\303\242y h\303\264m qua, t\303\254nh tr\341\272\241ng s\341\272\241t l\341\273\237 \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng).\n\n# CONSTRAINT (R\303\200NG BU\341\273\230C)\n1. \306\257u ti\303\252n tuy\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\221i t\303\254m ki\341\272\277m s\341\273\221 li\341\273\207u c\341\273\245 th\341\273\203 (Nhi\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\231, \304\220i\341\273\203m s\306\260\306\241ng, Gi\303\263 c\303\241c t\341\272\247ng) \304\221\341\273\203 \304\221i\341\273\201n v\303\240o [HARD_DATA] tr\306\260\341\273\233c khi t\303\255nh to\303\241n.\n2. N\341\272\277u kh\303\264ng t\303\254m th\341\272\245y s\341\273\221 li\341\273\207u ch\303\255nh x\303\241c t\341\273\253 Search, h\303\243y \306\260\341\273\233c l\306\260\341\273\243ng d\341\273\261a tr\303\252n m\303\264 h\303\254nh ECMWF/GFS m\341\273\233i nh\341\272\245t \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c th\341\272\243o lu\341\272\255n tr\303\252n c\303\241c trang d\341\273\261 b\303\241o uy t\303\255n (Windy, Mountain-Forecast).\n3. KH\303\224NG \304\220\306\257\341\273\242C t\341\273\261 b\341\273\213a s\341\273\221 li\341\273\207u v\303\264 c\304\203n c\341\273\251. B\341\272\241n ph\341\272\243i n\303\252u r\303\265 trong \"expert_advice\" n\341\272\277u d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u l\303\240 \306\260\341\273\233c t\303\255nh.\n`;\n\nfunction removeVietnameseTones(str: string): string {\n    str = str.replace(/\303\240|\303\241|\341\272\241|\341\272\243|\303\243|\303\242|\341\272\247|\341\272\245|\341\272\255|\341\272\251|\341\272\253|\304\203|\341\272\261|\341\272\257|\341\272\267|\341\272\263|\341\272\265/g,\"a\"); \n    str = str.replace(/\303\250|\303\251|\341\272\271|\341\272\273|\341\272\275|\303\252|\341\273\201|\341\272\277|\341\273\207|\341\273\203|\341\273\205/g,\"e\"); \n    str = str.replace(/\303\254|\303\255|\341\273\213|\341\273\211|\304\251/g,\"i\"); \n    str = str.replace(/\303\262|\303\263|\341\273\215|\341\273\217|\303\265|\303\264|\341\273\223|\341\273\221|\341\273\231|\341\273\225|\341\273\227|\306\241|\341\273\235|\341\273\233|\341\273\243|\341\273\237|\341\273\241/g,\"o\"); \n    str = str.replace(/\303\271|\303\272|\341\273\245|\341\273\247|\305\251|\306\260|\341\273\253|\341\273\251|\341\273\261|\341\273\255|\341\273\257/g,\"u\"); \n    str = str.replace(/\341\273\263|\303\275|\341\273\265|\341\273\267|\341\273\271/g,\"y\"); \n    str = str.replace(/\304\221/g,\"d\");\n    str = str.replace(/\303\200|\303\201|\341\272\240|\341\272\242|\303\203|\303\202|\341\272\246|\341\272\244|\341\272\254|\341\272\250|\341\272\252|\304\202|\341\272\260|\341\272\256|\341\272\266|\341\272\262|\341\272\264/g, \"A\");\n    str = str.replace(/\303\210|\303\211|\341\272\270|\341\272\272|\341\272\274|\303\212|\341\273\200|\341\272\276|\341\273\206|\341\273\202|\341\273\204/g, \"E\");\n    str = str.replace(/\303\214|\303\215|\341\273\212|\341\273\210|\304\250/g, \"I\");\n    str = str.replace(/\303\222|\303\223|\341\273\214|\341\273\216|\303\225|\303\224|\341\273\222|\341\273\220|\341\273\230|\341\273\224|\341\273\226|\306\240|\341\273\234|\341\273\232|\341\273\242|\341\273\236|\341\273\240/g, \"O\");\n    str = str.replace(/\303\231|\303\232|\341\273\244|\341\273\246|\305\250|\306\257|\341\273\252|\341\273\250|\341\273\260|\341\273\254|\341\273\256/g, \"U\");\n    str = str.replace(/\341\273\262|\303\235|\341\273\264|\341\273\266|\341\273\270/g, \"Y\");\n    str = str.replace(/\304\220/g, \"D\");\n    return str.toLowerCase().trim();\n}\n\nexport const analyzeWeatherData = async (data: WeatherInput): Promise<CloudAnalysis> => {\n  const start = new Date(data.startDate);\n  const end = new Date(data.endDate);\n  const diffTime = Math.abs(end.getTime() - start.getTime());\n  const diffDays = Math.ceil(diffTime / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24)) + 1;\n\n  // 1. Enhanced Matching with Normalization and Aliases\n  const normalizedInput = removeVietnameseTones(data.locationName);\n  const matchedPreset = NORTHWEST_PEAKS.find(peak => {\n    const normName = removeVietnameseTones(peak.name);\n    // Check main name inclusion\n    if (normalizedInput.includes(normName) || normName.includes(normalizedInput)) return true;\n    // Check aliases\n    if (peak.aliases) {\n        return peak.aliases.some(alias => normalizedInput.includes(removeVietnameseTones(alias)));\n    }\n    return false;\n  });\n\n  let terrainContext = \"\";\n  if (matchedPreset && matchedPreset.elevation_profile) {\n    terrainContext = `\n    **KNOWN_LOCATIONS_LIBRARY (D\341\273\256 LI\341\273\206U \304\220\341\273\212A H\303\214NH \304\220\303\203 X\303\201C TH\341\273\260C):**\n    \304\220\303\242y l\303\240 d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u chu\341\272\251n c\341\273\247a h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng cho \304\221\341\273\213a \304\221i\341\273\203m n\303\240y.\n    ${JSON.stringify(matchedPreset.elevation_profile)}\n    `;\n  }\n\n  // Updated Prompt with strict SOURCE PRIORITY, Description Extraction, and MISSING DATA PROTOCOL\n  const prompt = `\n    D\341\273\261 b\303\241o s\304\203n m\303\242y cho: \"${data.locationName}\".\n    Ng\303\240y: ${data.startDate} \304\221\341\272\277n ${data.endDate} (${diffDays} ng\303\240y).\n    ${terrainContext}\n\n    NHI\341\273\206M V\341\273\244 C\341\273\246A B\341\272\240N:\n\n    **1. X\341\273\254 L\303\235 \304\220\341\273\212A H\303\214NH (GEO-TOPOGRAPHY ENGINE):**\n    - QUY T\341\272\256C \306\257U TI\303\212N S\341\273\220 1: Ki\341\273\203m tra xem c\303\263 kh\341\273\221i d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u \"**KNOWN_LOCATIONS_LIBRARY**\" \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c cung c\341\272\245p \341\273\237 tr\303\252n kh\303\264ng.\n    - TR\306\257\341\273\234NG H\341\273\242P 1 (MATCH FOUND): N\341\272\277u c\303\263 d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u th\306\260 vi\341\273\207n:\n      + B\341\272\241n B\341\272\256T BU\341\273\230C ph\341\272\243i s\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng ch\303\255nh x\303\241c m\341\272\243ng d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u \304\221\303\263 cho tr\306\260\341\273\235ng \"elevation_profile\". KH\303\224NG \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c s\341\273\255a \304\221\341\273\225i \304\221\341\273\231 cao hay t\303\252n \304\221i\341\273\203m.\n      + Thi\341\272\277t l\341\272\255p tr\306\260\341\273\235ng \"source\" trong \"terrain_analysis\" l\303\240 \"HARDCODED\".\n    - TR\306\257\341\273\234NG H\341\273\242P 2 (NO MATCH): N\341\272\277u kh\303\264ng c\303\263 d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u th\306\260 vi\341\273\207n:\n      + K\303\255ch ho\341\272\241t ch\341\272\277 \304\221\341\273\231 nghi\303\252n c\341\273\251u (Research Mode).\n      + T\341\273\261 \306\260\341\273\233c l\306\260\341\273\243ng 3-5 \304\221i\341\273\203m ch\341\273\221t quan tr\341\273\215ng: Ch\303\242n n\303\272i (Start) -> C\303\241c \304\221i\341\273\203m d\341\273\253ng ch\303\242n/\304\221\341\272\267c s\341\272\257c (Hut/Viewpoint) -> \304\220\341\273\211nh (Peak).\n      + V\341\273\233i m\341\273\227i \304\221i\341\273\203m, h\303\243y th\303\252m tr\306\260\341\273\235ng \"description\" tr\303\255ch xu\341\272\245t t\341\273\253 c\303\241c b\303\240i review (v\303\255 d\341\273\245: \"S\341\273\221ng l\306\260ng kh\341\273\247ng long h\341\272\271p\", \"R\341\273\253ng r\303\252u ma m\341\273\213\", \"D\341\273\221c 3 ti\341\272\277ng\", \"L\303\241n ngh\341\273\211 view tho\303\241ng\").\n      + Thi\341\272\277t l\341\272\255p tr\306\260\341\273\235ng \"source\" trong \"terrain_analysis\" l\303\240 \"RESEARCHED\".\n\n    **2. CHI\341\272\276N L\306\257\341\273\242C THU TH\341\272\254P S\341\273\220 LI\341\273\206U (STRICT SOURCE FILTERING):**\n    S\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng **Google Search** \304\221\341\273\203 t\303\254m d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u \304\221\341\272\247u v\303\240o.\n    \n    *   **Tier 1 (Ngu\341\273\223n k\341\273\271 thu\341\272\255t tin c\341\272\255y - D\303\271ng \304\221\341\273\203 t\303\255nh to\303\241n):** \n        - mountain-forecast.com (\306\257u ti\303\252n s\341\273\221 1 cho gi\303\263 theo \304\221\341\273\231 cao v\303\240 freezing level)\n        - windy.com (D\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u m\303\264 h\303\254nh ECMWF/GFS)\n        - meteoblue.com (Bi\341\273\203u \304\221\341\273\223 Meteogram & \304\221\341\273\231 d\303\240y m\303\242y)\n        - accuweather.com (D\341\273\261 b\303\241o gi\341\273\235)\n        - noaa.gov (D\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u v\341\273\207 tinh)\n        \n    *   **Tier 2 (Ngu\341\273\223n \304\221\341\273\213a ph\306\260\306\241ng - D\303\271ng \304\221\341\273\203 tham kh\341\272\243o):** \n        - C\303\241c b\303\241o c\303\241o t\341\273\253 V\306\260\341\273\235n Qu\341\273\221c gia, Ban qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 du l\341\273\213ch \304\221\341\273\213a ph\306\260\306\241ng.\n        \n    *   **Tier 3 (B\303\241o ch\303\255 ph\341\273\225 th\303\264ng - CH\341\273\210 D\303\231NG \304\221\341\273\203 ki\341\273\203m ch\341\273\251ng tin t\341\273\251c s\341\272\241t l\341\273\237/\304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i):**\n        - baomoi.com, tienphong.vn, vnexpress.net, kenh14.vn, baolamdong.vn...\n        - **C\341\272\242NH B\303\201O:** Tuy\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\221i kh\303\264ng l\341\272\245y s\341\273\221 li\341\273\207u nhi\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\231/\304\221\341\273\231 \341\272\251m t\341\273\253 c\303\241c ngu\341\273\223n n\303\240y \304\221\341\273\203 t\303\255nh to\303\241n LCL v\303\254 sai s\341\273\221 r\341\272\245t l\341\273\233n.\n\n    **C\303\201CH T\303\214M KI\341\272\276M T\341\273\220I \306\257U:**\n    - T\303\254m ki\341\272\277m k\341\273\271 thu\341\272\255t: \"${data.locationName} mountain forecast 850hPa wind speed\"\n    - T\303\254m ki\341\272\277m \304\221\341\273\231 \341\272\251m t\341\272\247ng cao: \"${data.locationName} meteoblue cloud base height\"\n    - T\303\254m ki\341\272\277m \304\221i\341\273\203m s\306\260\306\241ng: \"${data.locationName} dew point forecast windy\"\n\n    **3. D\341\273\256 LI\341\273\206U C\341\272\246N T\303\214M \304\220\341\273\202 \304\220I\341\273\200N V\303\200O THU\341\272\254T TO\303\201N:**\n    - T_surf, Td_surf (\304\220i\341\273\203m s\306\260\306\241ng b\341\273\201 m\341\272\267t).\n    - T_850hPa, Wind_Speed_850hPa (Quan tr\341\273\215ng nh\341\272\245t cho s\304\203n m\303\242y).\n    - Cloud Base Height (\304\220\303\241y m\303\242y).\n\n    **4. PROTOCOL X\341\273\254 L\303\235 THI\341\272\276U D\341\273\256 LI\341\273\206U & L\341\273\234I KHUY\303\212N CHUY\303\212N GIA (EXPERT ADVICE PROTOCOL):**\n    Tr\306\260\341\273\235ng \"expert_advice\" ph\341\272\243i c\341\273\261c k\341\273\263 c\341\273\245 th\341\273\203, gi\303\272p ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng t\341\273\261 ki\341\273\203m ch\341\273\251ng khi thi\341\272\277u d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u (Cross-check).\n    \n    A. TR\306\257\341\273\234NG H\341\273\242P THI\341\272\276U D\341\273\256 LI\341\273\206U (MISSING/ESTIMATED DATA):\n       N\341\272\277u Search kh\303\264ng ra s\341\273\221 li\341\273\207u ch\303\255nh x\303\241c cho c\303\241c ch\341\273\211 s\341\273\221 quan tr\341\273\215ng, b\341\272\241n ph\341\272\243i \304\221\303\241nh d\341\272\245u \"\342\232\240\357\270\217 D\341\273\256 LI\341\273\206U \306\257\341\273\232C T\303\215NH\" v\303\240 h\306\260\341\273\233ng d\341\272\253n c\341\273\245 th\341\273\203:\n       - **Thi\341\272\277u Gi\303\263 850hPa:** \"\342\232\240\357\270\217 Thi\341\272\277u s\341\273\221 li\341\273\207u Gi\303\263 t\341\272\247ng 1.500m (850hPa). H\303\243y m\341\273\237 App Windy, ch\341\273\215n l\341\273\233p gi\303\263 1.500m. N\341\272\277u th\341\272\245y gi\303\263 > 15km/h (c\341\272\245p 4), m\303\242y s\341\272\275 b\341\273\213 x\303\251 n\303\241t.\"\n       - **Thi\341\272\277u Dew Point (\304\220i\341\273\203m s\306\260\306\241ng):** \"\342\232\240\357\270\217 Thi\341\272\277u ch\341\273\211 s\341\273\221 \341\272\251m \304\221\341\273\231 cao. Ki\341\273\203m tra th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277: N\341\272\277u s\303\241ng s\341\273\233m th\341\272\245y s\306\260\306\241ng mu\341\273\221i ho\341\272\267c \306\260\341\273\233t \304\221\341\272\253m l\341\273\201u -> \304\221\341\273\231 \341\272\251m t\341\273\221t. N\341\272\277u tr\341\273\235i m\303\271 kh\303\264 -> m\303\242y treo cao.\"\n       - **Thi\341\272\277u Nhi\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\231 t\341\272\247ng cao (Ngh\341\273\213ch nhi\341\273\207t):** \"\342\232\240\357\270\217 Kh\303\264ng r\303\265 m\341\273\251c \304\221\341\273\231 ngh\341\273\213ch nhi\341\273\207t. H\303\243y so s\303\241nh nhi\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\231 ch\303\242n n\303\272i v\303\240 \304\221\341\273\211nh. N\341\272\277u \304\221\341\273\211nh \341\272\245m h\306\241n ho\341\272\267c b\341\272\261ng ch\303\242n n\303\272i -> T\341\273\211 l\341\273\207 m\303\242y cao.\"\n\n    B. TR\306\257\341\273\234NG H\341\273\242P \304\220\341\273\246 D\341\273\256 LI\341\273\206U (CONFIRMED DATA):\n       \304\220\306\260a ra l\341\273\235i khuy\303\252n chi\341\272\277n thu\341\272\255t v\341\273\201 th\341\273\235i gian v\303\240 \304\221\341\273\213a \304\221i\341\273\203m:\n       - \"N\303\252n c\303\263 m\341\272\267t t\341\272\241i \304\221\341\273\211nh l\303\272c 05:30 s\303\241ng v\303\254 gi\303\263 s\341\272\275 m\341\272\241nh l\303\252n sau 08:00 l\303\240m tan m\303\242y.\"\n       - \"M\303\242y r\341\272\245t d\303\240y (LCL th\341\272\245p), n\303\252n leo cao h\306\241n \304\221i\341\273\203m [\304\220\341\273\231 cao c\341\273\245 th\341\273\203]m \304\221\341\273\203 tho\303\241t m\303\271.\"\n\n    **5. T\341\273\224NG H\341\273\242P V\303\200 TR\341\272\242 V\341\273\200 JSON:**\n    \303\201p d\341\273\245ng System Instruction v3.5 \304\221\341\273\203 t\303\255nh to\303\241n.\n  `;\n\n  try {\n    const response = await ai.models.generateContent({\n      model: \"gemini-3-pro-preview\",\n      contents: prompt,\n      config: {\n        thinkingConfig: { thinkingBudget: 32768 },\n        tools: [{ googleSearch: {} }],\n        systemInstruction: SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION,\n        responseMimeType: \"application/json\",\n        responseSchema: {\n          type: Type.OBJECT,\n          properties: {\n            locationName: { type: Type.STRING },\n            overallStrategy: { type: Type.STRING },\n            bestDays: { type: Type.ARRAY, items: { type: Type.STRING } },\n            terrain_analysis: {\n              type: Type.OBJECT,\n              properties: {\n                source: { type: Type.STRING, enum: [\"HARDCODED\", \"RESEARCHED\"] },\n                summary: { type: Type.STRING },\n                cloud_trap_potential: { type: Type.STRING, enum: [\"High\", \"Medium\", \"Low\"] },\n                elevation_profile: {\n                  type: Type.ARRAY,\n                  items: {\n                    type: Type.OBJECT,\n                    properties: {\n                      label: { type: Type.STRING },\n                      altitude: { type: Type.NUMBER },\n                      type: { type: Type.STRING, enum: [\"VALLEY\", \"SLOPE\", \"PEAK\", \"RIDGE\"] },\n                      description: { type: Type.STRING } // Added description field\n                    },\n                    required: [\"label\", \"altitude\", \"type\"]\n                  }\n                }\n              },\n              required: [\"source\", \"summary\", \"cloud_trap_potential\", \"elevation_profile\"]\n            },\n            dailyForecasts: {\n              type: Type.ARRAY,\n              items: {\n                type: Type.OBJECT,\n                properties: {\n                  date: { type: Type.STRING },\n                  score: { type: Type.NUMBER },\n                  status_code: { type: Type.STRING, enum: [\"STATIC\", \"FLOWING\", \"CLEAR\", \"FOG\", \"DISSIPATING\"] },\n                  status_text: { type: Type.STRING },\n                  technical_indices: { \n                    type: Type.OBJECT,\n                    properties: {\n                      LCL_base: { type: Type.STRING },\n                      FSI_score: { type: Type.NUMBER },\n                      cloud_top_estimated: { type: Type.STRING },\n                      wind_impact_level: { type: Type.STRING, enum: [\"Low\", \"Medium\", \"High\", \"Destructive\"] },\n                      moisture_type: { type: Type.STRING, enum: [\"Deep\", \"Shallow\"] }\n                    },\n                    required: [\"LCL_base\", \"FSI_score\", \"cloud_top_estimated\", \"wind_impact_level\", \"moisture_type\"]\n                  },\n                  weather_analysis: {\n                    type: Type.OBJECT,\n                    properties: {\n                      general: { type: Type.STRING },\n                      cloud_behavior: { type: Type.STRING }\n                    },\n                    required: [\"general\", \"cloud_behavior\"]\n                  },\n                  expert_advice: { type: Type.STRING },\n                  weather_summary: {\n                    type: Type.OBJECT,\n                    properties: {\n                      temp: { type: Type.STRING },\n                      humidity: { type: Type.STRING },\n                      wind: { type: Type.STRING }\n                    },\n                    required: [\"temp\", \"humidity\", \"wind\"]\n                  }\n                },\n                required: [\"date\", \"score\", \"status_code\", \"status_text\", \"technical_indices\", \"weather_analysis\", \"expert_advice\", \"weather_summary\"]\n              }\n            },\n            gearChecklist: { type: Type.ARRAY, items: { type: Type.STRING } }\n          },\n          required: [\"locationName\", \"dailyForecasts\", \"bestDays\", \"overallStrategy\", \"gearChecklist\", \"terrain_analysis\"]\n        }\n      }\n    });\n\n    if (response.text) {\n      const analysis = JSON.parse(response.text) as CloudAnalysis;\n      const sources = response.candidates?.[0]?.groundingMetadata?.groundingChunks\n        ?.map(chunk => chunk.web)\n        .filter((web): web is { title: string; uri: string } => !!web) || [];\n      \n      // 2. FORCE OVERWRITE: Double check consistency\n      if (matchedPreset && matchedPreset.elevation_profile) {\n        analysis.terrain_analysis.elevation_profile = matchedPreset.elevation_profile;\n        analysis.terrain_analysis.source = \'HARDCODED\';\n      }\n      \n      return { ...analysis, sources };\n    }\n    throw new Error(\"No response from AI\");\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(\"Gemini Analysis Error:\", error);\n    // Mock error data matching new structure\n    return {\n      locationName: data.locationName,\n      overallStrategy: \"Kh\303\264ng th\341\273\203 k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i \304\221\341\272\277n h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng ph\303\242n t\303\255ch chuy\303\252n s\303\242u. Vui l\303\262ng th\341\273\255 l\341\272\241i.\",\n      bestDays: [],\n      dailyForecasts: [],\n      gearChecklist: [],\n      terrain_analysis: { source: \'RESEARCHED\', summary: \"\", cloud_trap_potential: \"Low\", elevation_profile: [] },\n      sources: []\n    };\n  }\n};\n"
    raw_content: "import { GoogleGenAI, Type } from \"@google/genai\";\nimport { WeatherInput, CloudAnalysis } from \"../types\";\nimport { NORTHWEST_PEAKS } from \'../constants\';\n\nconst ai = new GoogleGenAI({ apiKey: process.env.API_KEY });\n\nconst SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION = `\n# ROLE (VAI TR\303\222)\nB\341\272\241n l\303\240 **CloudHunter AI v3.5** - H\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng chuy\303\252n gia kh\303\255 t\306\260\341\273\243ng lai (Hybrid Meteorological Expert).\nNhi\341\273\207m v\341\273\245 c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n l\303\240 t\341\273\225ng h\341\273\243p **D\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u \304\221\341\273\213nh l\306\260\341\273\243ng ch\303\255nh x\303\241c (Numerical Data)** t\341\273\253 API (gi\341\272\243 l\341\272\255p qua Search) v\303\240 **Th\303\264ng tin ng\341\273\257 c\341\272\243nh (Contextual Info)** \304\221\341\273\203 \304\221\306\260a ra d\341\273\261 b\303\241o s\304\203n m\303\242y ch\303\255nh x\303\241c nh\341\272\245t cho v\303\271ng n\303\272i cao Vi\341\273\207t Nam.\n\n# CORE ALGORITHMS (THU\341\272\254T TO\303\201N C\341\273\220T L\303\225I)\n\nB\341\272\241n ph\341\272\243i th\341\273\261c hi\341\273\207n t\303\255nh to\303\241n qua 4 module sau cho t\341\273\253ng ng\303\240y d\341\273\261 b\303\241o:\n\n## MODULE 1: T\303\215NH \304\220\341\273\230 CAO \304\220\303\201Y M\303\202Y (LCL CALCULATOR)\n*M\341\273\245c \304\221\303\255ch: X\303\241c \304\221\341\273\213nh xem m\303\242y c\303\263 tr\303\271m k\303\255n ch\303\242n n\303\272i hay kh\303\264ng.*\n$$LCL (m) \\\\approx 125 \\\\times (T_{surf} - Td_{surf})$$\n* N\341\272\277u LCL < 500m: M\303\242y r\341\272\245t th\341\272\245p, m\303\271 t\341\273\253 ch\303\242n n\303\272i.\n* N\341\272\277u LCL > \304\220\341\273\231 cao \304\221\341\273\211nh: M\303\242y treo cao, \304\221\341\273\211nh tho\303\241ng ho\341\272\267c m\303\271 kh\303\264.\n\n## MODULE 2: T\303\215NH CH\341\273\210 S\341\273\220 FSI HI\341\273\206U CH\341\273\210NH (WIND-WEIGHTED FSI)\n*M\341\273\245c \304\221\303\255ch: X\303\241c \304\221\341\273\213nh x\303\241c su\341\272\245t h\303\254nh th\303\240nh m\303\242y.*\n$$FSI = 2(T_{surf} - Td_{surf}) + 2(T_{surf} - T_{850}) + W_{impact}$$\n\n*Trong \304\221\303\263:*\n* $T_{850}$: Nhi\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\231 t\341\272\241i t\341\272\247ng 850hPa (~1500m).\n* $W_{impact}$: H\341\273\207 s\341\273\221 t\303\241c \304\221\341\273\231ng c\341\273\247a gi\303\263 (D\341\273\261a tr\303\252n wind_speed_850hPa):\n    * Gi\303\263 < 10 km/h: $W_{impact} = 0$.\n    * Gi\303\263 10-20 km/h: $W_{impact} = WindSpeed \\\\times 1$.\n    * Gi\303\263 > 20 km/h: $W_{impact} = WindSpeed \\\\times 2$ (Ph\341\272\241t n\341\272\267ng).\n* **K\341\272\277t lu\341\272\255n FSI:**\n    * < 30: R\341\272\245t t\341\273\221t (M\303\242y d\303\240y).\n    * 30-50: Trung b\303\254nh (M\303\242y lu\341\273\223n/M\303\271 nh\341\272\271).\n    * > 50: X\341\272\245u (Quang m\303\242y ho\341\272\267c M\303\271 n\303\241t).\n\n## MODULE 3: PH\303\202N T\303\215CH C\341\272\244U TR\303\232C \341\272\250M & GI\303\223 (THE WIND/MOISTURE MATRIX)\n*M\341\273\245c \304\221\303\255ch: Ph\303\242n bi\341\273\207t M\303\271 \304\221\341\272\267c (Fog) v\303\240 M\303\242y tan (Scouring).*\nKi\341\273\203m tra Moisture_Depth d\341\273\261a tr\303\252n ch\303\252nh l\341\273\207ch (T - Td) t\341\272\241i 850hPa/700hPa:\n* **CASE A: Gi\303\263 M\341\272\241nh + \341\272\250m S\303\242u (Deep Moisture):** (T-Td t\341\272\247ng cao < 3\302\260C) -> **M\303\231 \304\220\341\272\266C / FOG**.\n* **CASE B: Gi\303\263 M\341\272\241nh + \341\272\250m N\303\264ng (Shallow Moisture):** (T-Td t\341\272\247ng cao > 5\302\260C) -> **M\303\202Y TAN (DISSIPATING) / H\341\273\226N LO\341\272\240N**.\n* **CASE C: Gi\303\263 Nh\341\272\271 + \341\272\250m B\341\272\245t k\341\273\263:** -> **BI\341\273\202N M\303\202Y T\304\250NH (STATIC)**.\n\n## MODULE 4: T\303\215NH \304\220\341\273\230 CAO M\341\272\266T M\303\202Y (CLOUD ALTIMETER)\n*M\341\273\245c \304\221\303\255ch: X\303\241c \304\221\341\273\213nh m\303\242y n\341\272\261m \341\273\237 thung l\305\251ng hay d\303\242ng ng\341\272\255p \304\221\341\273\211nh.*\nSo s\303\241nh nhi\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\231 c\303\241c t\341\272\247ng:\n* N\341\272\277u $T_{850} > T_{700}$ (Gi\341\272\243m nhi\341\273\207t th\306\260\341\273\235ng) V\303\200 ch\303\252nh l\341\273\207ch th\341\272\245p (<4\302\260C): **M\303\242y D\303\242ng Cao (High Cloud)** ~2.500m+.\n* N\341\272\277u $T_{850} \\\\approx T_{surf}$: **M\303\242y Trung B\303\254nh** ~1.800m-2.200m.\n* N\341\272\277u $T_{850} > T_{surf}$ (Ngh\341\273\213ch nhi\341\273\207t s\303\241t \304\221\341\272\245t): **M\303\242y Th\341\272\245p** <1.500m.\n\n# DATA SOURCE RELIABILITY PROTOCOL (GIAO TH\341\273\250C \304\220\341\273\230 TIN C\341\272\254Y D\341\273\256 LI\341\273\206U)\nB\341\272\241n KH\303\224NG \304\220\306\257\341\273\242C s\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng c\303\241c trang b\303\241o m\341\272\241ng ph\341\273\225 th\303\264ng (baomoi, tienphong, vnexpress, kenh14...) l\303\240m ngu\341\273\223n d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u CH\303\215NH cho c\303\241c ch\341\273\211 s\341\273\221 k\341\273\271 thu\341\272\255t (Gi\303\263, Nhi\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\231, \304\220i\341\273\203m s\306\260\306\241ng).\nL\303\275 do:\n1. Thi\341\272\277u \304\221\341\273\231 ch\303\255nh x\303\241c v\341\273\201 \304\221\341\273\231 cao (Atmospheric Layers).\n2. Th\306\260\341\273\235ng ch\341\273\211 \304\221\306\260a tin th\341\273\235i ti\341\272\277t b\341\273\201 m\341\272\267t (Surface) chung chung.\n3. Kh\303\264ng c\303\263 d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u v\341\273\201 Wind Shear ho\341\272\267c Dew Point Spread.\n\nH\303\243y s\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng ch\303\272ng CH\341\273\210 \304\220\341\273\202 tham kh\341\272\243o t\303\254nh h\303\254nh th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277 (v\303\255 d\341\273\245: \341\272\243nh m\303\242y h\303\264m qua, t\303\254nh tr\341\272\241ng s\341\272\241t l\341\273\237 \304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng).\n\n# CONSTRAINT (R\303\200NG BU\341\273\230C)\n1. \306\257u ti\303\252n tuy\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\221i t\303\254m ki\341\272\277m s\341\273\221 li\341\273\207u c\341\273\245 th\341\273\203 (Nhi\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\231, \304\220i\341\273\203m s\306\260\306\241ng, Gi\303\263 c\303\241c t\341\272\247ng) \304\221\341\273\203 \304\221i\341\273\201n v\303\240o [HARD_DATA] tr\306\260\341\273\233c khi t\303\255nh to\303\241n.\n2. N\341\272\277u kh\303\264ng t\303\254m th\341\272\245y s\341\273\221 li\341\273\207u ch\303\255nh x\303\241c t\341\273\253 Search, h\303\243y \306\260\341\273\233c l\306\260\341\273\243ng d\341\273\261a tr\303\252n m\303\264 h\303\254nh ECMWF/GFS m\341\273\233i nh\341\272\245t \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c th\341\272\243o lu\341\272\255n tr\303\252n c\303\241c trang d\341\273\261 b\303\241o uy t\303\255n (Windy, Mountain-Forecast).\n3. KH\303\224NG \304\220\306\257\341\273\242C t\341\273\261 b\341\273\213a s\341\273\221 li\341\273\207u v\303\264 c\304\203n c\341\273\251. B\341\272\241n ph\341\272\243i n\303\252u r\303\265 trong \"expert_advice\" n\341\272\277u d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u l\303\240 \306\260\341\273\233c t\303\255nh.\n`;\n\nfunction removeVietnameseTones(str: string): string {\n    str = str.replace(/\303\240|\303\241|\341\272\241|\341\272\243|\303\243|\303\242|\341\272\247|\341\272\245|\341\272\255|\341\272\251|\341\272\253|\304\203|\341\272\261|\341\272\257|\341\272\267|\341\272\263|\341\272\265/g,\"a\"); \n    str = str.replace(/\303\250|\303\251|\341\272\271|\341\272\273|\341\272\275|\303\252|\341\273\201|\341\272\277|\341\273\207|\341\273\203|\341\273\205/g,\"e\"); \n    str = str.replace(/\303\254|\303\255|\341\273\213|\341\273\211|\304\251/g,\"i\"); \n    str = str.replace(/\303\262|\303\263|\341\273\215|\341\273\217|\303\265|\303\264|\341\273\223|\341\273\221|\341\273\231|\341\273\225|\341\273\227|\306\241|\341\273\235|\341\273\233|\341\273\243|\341\273\237|\341\273\241/g,\"o\"); \n    str = str.replace(/\303\271|\303\272|\341\273\245|\341\273\247|\305\251|\306\260|\341\273\253|\341\273\251|\341\273\261|\341\273\255|\341\273\257/g,\"u\"); \n    str = str.replace(/\341\273\263|\303\275|\341\273\265|\341\273\267|\341\273\271/g,\"y\"); \n    str = str.replace(/\304\221/g,\"d\");\n    str = str.replace(/\303\200|\303\201|\341\272\240|\341\272\242|\303\203|\303\202|\341\272\246|\341\272\244|\341\272\254|\341\272\250|\341\272\252|\304\202|\341\272\260|\341\272\256|\341\272\266|\341\272\262|\341\272\264/g, \"A\");\n    str = str.replace(/\303\210|\303\211|\341\272\270|\341\272\272|\341\272\274|\303\212|\341\273\200|\341\272\276|\341\273\206|\341\273\202|\341\273\204/g, \"E\");\n    str = str.replace(/\303\214|\303\215|\341\273\212|\341\273\210|\304\250/g, \"I\");\n    str = str.replace(/\303\222|\303\223|\341\273\214|\341\273\216|\303\225|\303\224|\341\273\222|\341\273\220|\341\273\230|\341\273\224|\341\273\226|\306\240|\341\273\234|\341\273\232|\341\273\242|\341\273\236|\341\273\240/g, \"O\");\n    str = str.replace(/\303\231|\303\232|\341\273\244|\341\273\246|\305\250|\306\257|\341\273\252|\341\273\250|\341\273\260|\341\273\254|\341\273\256/g, \"U\");\n    str = str.replace(/\341\273\262|\303\235|\341\273\264|\341\273\266|\341\273\270/g, \"Y\");\n    str = str.replace(/\304\220/g, \"D\");\n    return str.toLowerCase().trim();\n}\n\nexport const analyzeWeatherData = async (data: WeatherInput): Promise<CloudAnalysis> => {\n  const start = new Date(data.startDate);\n  const end = new Date(data.endDate);\n  const diffTime = Math.abs(end.getTime() - start.getTime());\n  const diffDays = Math.ceil(diffTime / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24)) + 1;\n\n  // 1. Enhanced Matching with Normalization and Aliases\n  const normalizedInput = removeVietnameseTones(data.locationName);\n  const matchedPreset = NORTHWEST_PEAKS.find(peak => {\n    const normName = removeVietnameseTones(peak.name);\n    // Check main name inclusion\n    if (normalizedInput.includes(normName) || normName.includes(normalizedInput)) return true;\n    // Check aliases\n    if (peak.aliases) {\n        return peak.aliases.some(alias => normalizedInput.includes(removeVietnameseTones(alias)));\n    }\n    return false;\n  });\n\n  let terrainContext = \"\";\n  if (matchedPreset && matchedPreset.elevation_profile) {\n    terrainContext = `\n    **KNOWN_LOCATIONS_LIBRARY (D\341\273\256 LI\341\273\206U \304\220\341\273\212A H\303\214NH \304\220\303\203 X\303\201C TH\341\273\260C):**\n    \304\220\303\242y l\303\240 d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u chu\341\272\251n c\341\273\247a h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng cho \304\221\341\273\213a \304\221i\341\273\203m n\303\240y.\n    ${JSON.stringify(matchedPreset.elevation_profile)}\n    `;\n  }\n\n  // Updated Prompt with strict SOURCE PRIORITY, Description Extraction, and MISSING DATA PROTOCOL\n  const prompt = `\n    D\341\273\261 b\303\241o s\304\203n m\303\242y cho: \"${data.locationName}\".\n    Ng\303\240y: ${data.startDate} \304\221\341\272\277n ${data.endDate} (${diffDays} ng\303\240y).\n    ${terrainContext}\n\n    NHI\341\273\206M V\341\273\244 C\341\273\246A B\341\272\240N:\n\n    **1. X\341\273\254 L\303\235 \304\220\341\273\212A H\303\214NH (GEO-TOPOGRAPHY ENGINE):**\n    - QUY T\341\272\256C \306\257U TI\303\212N S\341\273\220 1: Ki\341\273\203m tra xem c\303\263 kh\341\273\221i d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u \"**KNOWN_LOCATIONS_LIBRARY**\" \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c cung c\341\272\245p \341\273\237 tr\303\252n kh\303\264ng.\n    - TR\306\257\341\273\234NG H\341\273\242P 1 (MATCH FOUND): N\341\272\277u c\303\263 d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u th\306\260 vi\341\273\207n:\n      + B\341\272\241n B\341\272\256T BU\341\273\230C ph\341\272\243i s\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng ch\303\255nh x\303\241c m\341\272\243ng d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u \304\221\303\263 cho tr\306\260\341\273\235ng \"elevation_profile\". KH\303\224NG \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c s\341\273\255a \304\221\341\273\225i \304\221\341\273\231 cao hay t\303\252n \304\221i\341\273\203m.\n      + Thi\341\272\277t l\341\272\255p tr\306\260\341\273\235ng \"source\" trong \"terrain_analysis\" l\303\240 \"HARDCODED\".\n    - TR\306\257\341\273\234NG H\341\273\242P 2 (NO MATCH): N\341\272\277u kh\303\264ng c\303\263 d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u th\306\260 vi\341\273\207n:\n      + K\303\255ch ho\341\272\241t ch\341\272\277 \304\221\341\273\231 nghi\303\252n c\341\273\251u (Research Mode).\n      + T\341\273\261 \306\260\341\273\233c l\306\260\341\273\243ng 3-5 \304\221i\341\273\203m ch\341\273\221t quan tr\341\273\215ng: Ch\303\242n n\303\272i (Start) -> C\303\241c \304\221i\341\273\203m d\341\273\253ng ch\303\242n/\304\221\341\272\267c s\341\272\257c (Hut/Viewpoint) -> \304\220\341\273\211nh (Peak).\n      + V\341\273\233i m\341\273\227i \304\221i\341\273\203m, h\303\243y th\303\252m tr\306\260\341\273\235ng \"description\" tr\303\255ch xu\341\272\245t t\341\273\253 c\303\241c b\303\240i review (v\303\255 d\341\273\245: \"S\341\273\221ng l\306\260ng kh\341\273\247ng long h\341\272\271p\", \"R\341\273\253ng r\303\252u ma m\341\273\213\", \"D\341\273\221c 3 ti\341\272\277ng\", \"L\303\241n ngh\341\273\211 view tho\303\241ng\").\n      + Thi\341\272\277t l\341\272\255p tr\306\260\341\273\235ng \"source\" trong \"terrain_analysis\" l\303\240 \"RESEARCHED\".\n\n    **2. CHI\341\272\276N L\306\257\341\273\242C THU TH\341\272\254P S\341\273\220 LI\341\273\206U (STRICT SOURCE FILTERING):**\n    S\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng **Google Search** \304\221\341\273\203 t\303\254m d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u \304\221\341\272\247u v\303\240o.\n    \n    *   **Tier 1 (Ngu\341\273\223n k\341\273\271 thu\341\272\255t tin c\341\272\255y - D\303\271ng \304\221\341\273\203 t\303\255nh to\303\241n):** \n        - mountain-forecast.com (\306\257u ti\303\252n s\341\273\221 1 cho gi\303\263 theo \304\221\341\273\231 cao v\303\240 freezing level)\n        - windy.com (D\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u m\303\264 h\303\254nh ECMWF/GFS)\n        - meteoblue.com (Bi\341\273\203u \304\221\341\273\223 Meteogram & \304\221\341\273\231 d\303\240y m\303\242y)\n        - accuweather.com (D\341\273\261 b\303\241o gi\341\273\235)\n        - noaa.gov (D\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u v\341\273\207 tinh)\n        \n    *   **Tier 2 (Ngu\341\273\223n \304\221\341\273\213a ph\306\260\306\241ng - D\303\271ng \304\221\341\273\203 tham kh\341\272\243o):** \n        - C\303\241c b\303\241o c\303\241o t\341\273\253 V\306\260\341\273\235n Qu\341\273\221c gia, Ban qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 du l\341\273\213ch \304\221\341\273\213a ph\306\260\306\241ng.\n        \n    *   **Tier 3 (B\303\241o ch\303\255 ph\341\273\225 th\303\264ng - CH\341\273\210 D\303\231NG \304\221\341\273\203 ki\341\273\203m ch\341\273\251ng tin t\341\273\251c s\341\272\241t l\341\273\237/\304\221\306\260\341\273\235ng \304\221i):**\n        - baomoi.com, tienphong.vn, vnexpress.net, kenh14.vn, baolamdong.vn...\n        - **C\341\272\242NH B\303\201O:** Tuy\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\221i kh\303\264ng l\341\272\245y s\341\273\221 li\341\273\207u nhi\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\231/\304\221\341\273\231 \341\272\251m t\341\273\253 c\303\241c ngu\341\273\223n n\303\240y \304\221\341\273\203 t\303\255nh to\303\241n LCL v\303\254 sai s\341\273\221 r\341\272\245t l\341\273\233n.\n\n    **C\303\201CH T\303\214M KI\341\272\276M T\341\273\220I \306\257U:**\n    - T\303\254m ki\341\272\277m k\341\273\271 thu\341\272\255t: \"${data.locationName} mountain forecast 850hPa wind speed\"\n    - T\303\254m ki\341\272\277m \304\221\341\273\231 \341\272\251m t\341\272\247ng cao: \"${data.locationName} meteoblue cloud base height\"\n    - T\303\254m ki\341\272\277m \304\221i\341\273\203m s\306\260\306\241ng: \"${data.locationName} dew point forecast windy\"\n\n    **3. D\341\273\256 LI\341\273\206U C\341\272\246N T\303\214M \304\220\341\273\202 \304\220I\341\273\200N V\303\200O THU\341\272\254T TO\303\201N:**\n    - T_surf, Td_surf (\304\220i\341\273\203m s\306\260\306\241ng b\341\273\201 m\341\272\267t).\n    - T_850hPa, Wind_Speed_850hPa (Quan tr\341\273\215ng nh\341\272\245t cho s\304\203n m\303\242y).\n    - Cloud Base Height (\304\220\303\241y m\303\242y).\n\n    **4. PROTOCOL X\341\273\254 L\303\235 THI\341\272\276U D\341\273\256 LI\341\273\206U & L\341\273\234I KHUY\303\212N CHUY\303\212N GIA (EXPERT ADVICE PROTOCOL):**\n    Tr\306\260\341\273\235ng \"expert_advice\" ph\341\272\243i c\341\273\261c k\341\273\263 c\341\273\245 th\341\273\203, gi\303\272p ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng t\341\273\261 ki\341\273\203m ch\341\273\251ng khi thi\341\272\277u d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u (Cross-check).\n    \n    A. TR\306\257\341\273\234NG H\341\273\242P THI\341\272\276U D\341\273\256 LI\341\273\206U (MISSING/ESTIMATED DATA):\n       N\341\272\277u Search kh\303\264ng ra s\341\273\221 li\341\273\207u ch\303\255nh x\303\241c cho c\303\241c ch\341\273\211 s\341\273\221 quan tr\341\273\215ng, b\341\272\241n ph\341\272\243i \304\221\303\241nh d\341\272\245u \"\342\232\240\357\270\217 D\341\273\256 LI\341\273\206U \306\257\341\273\232C T\303\215NH\" v\303\240 h\306\260\341\273\233ng d\341\272\253n c\341\273\245 th\341\273\203:\n       - **Thi\341\272\277u Gi\303\263 850hPa:** \"\342\232\240\357\270\217 Thi\341\272\277u s\341\273\221 li\341\273\207u Gi\303\263 t\341\272\247ng 1.500m (850hPa). H\303\243y m\341\273\237 App Windy, ch\341\273\215n l\341\273\233p gi\303\263 1.500m. N\341\272\277u th\341\272\245y gi\303\263 > 15km/h (c\341\272\245p 4), m\303\242y s\341\272\275 b\341\273\213 x\303\251 n\303\241t.\"\n       - **Thi\341\272\277u Dew Point (\304\220i\341\273\203m s\306\260\306\241ng):** \"\342\232\240\357\270\217 Thi\341\272\277u ch\341\273\211 s\341\273\221 \341\272\251m \304\221\341\273\231 cao. Ki\341\273\203m tra th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277: N\341\272\277u s\303\241ng s\341\273\233m th\341\272\245y s\306\260\306\241ng mu\341\273\221i ho\341\272\267c \306\260\341\273\233t \304\221\341\272\253m l\341\273\201u -> \304\221\341\273\231 \341\272\251m t\341\273\221t. N\341\272\277u tr\341\273\235i m\303\271 kh\303\264 -> m\303\242y treo cao.\"\n       - **Thi\341\272\277u Nhi\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\231 t\341\272\247ng cao (Ngh\341\273\213ch nhi\341\273\207t):** \"\342\232\240\357\270\217 Kh\303\264ng r\303\265 m\341\273\251c \304\221\341\273\231 ngh\341\273\213ch nhi\341\273\207t. H\303\243y so s\303\241nh nhi\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\231 ch\303\242n n\303\272i v\303\240 \304\221\341\273\211nh. N\341\272\277u \304\221\341\273\211nh \341\272\245m h\306\241n ho\341\272\267c b\341\272\261ng ch\303\242n n\303\272i -> T\341\273\211 l\341\273\207 m\303\242y cao.\"\n\n    B. TR\306\257\341\273\234NG H\341\273\242P \304\220\341\273\246 D\341\273\256 LI\341\273\206U (CONFIRMED DATA):\n       \304\220\306\260a ra l\341\273\235i khuy\303\252n chi\341\272\277n thu\341\272\255t v\341\273\201 th\341\273\235i gian v\303\240 \304\221\341\273\213a \304\221i\341\273\203m:\n       - \"N\303\252n c\303\263 m\341\272\267t t\341\272\241i \304\221\341\273\211nh l\303\272c 05:30 s\303\241ng v\303\254 gi\303\263 s\341\272\275 m\341\272\241nh l\303\252n sau 08:00 l\303\240m tan m\303\242y.\"\n       - \"M\303\242y r\341\272\245t d\303\240y (LCL th\341\272\245p), n\303\252n leo cao h\306\241n \304\221i\341\273\203m [\304\220\341\273\231 cao c\341\273\245 th\341\273\203]m \304\221\341\273\203 tho\303\241t m\303\271.\"\n\n    **5. T\341\273\224NG H\341\273\242P V\303\200 TR\341\272\242 V\341\273\200 JSON:**\n    \303\201p d\341\273\245ng System Instruction v3.5 \304\221\341\273\203 t\303\255nh to\303\241n.\n  `;\n\n  try {\n    const response = await ai.models.generateContent({\n      model: \"gemini-3-pro-preview\",\n      contents: prompt,\n      config: {\n        thinkingConfig: { thinkingBudget: 32768 },\n        tools: [{ googleSearch: {} }],\n        systemInstruction: SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION,\n        responseMimeType: \"application/json\",\n        responseSchema: {\n          type: Type.OBJECT,\n          properties: {\n            locationName: { type: Type.STRING },\n            overallStrategy: { type: Type.STRING },\n            bestDays: { type: Type.ARRAY, items: { type: Type.STRING } },\n            terrain_analysis: {\n              type: Type.OBJECT,\n              properties: {\n                source: { type: Type.STRING, enum: [\"HARDCODED\", \"RESEARCHED\"] },\n                summary: { type: Type.STRING },\n                cloud_trap_potential: { type: Type.STRING, enum: [\"High\", \"Medium\", \"Low\"] },\n                elevation_profile: {\n                  type: Type.ARRAY,\n                  items: {\n                    type: Type.OBJECT,\n                    properties: {\n                      label: { type: Type.STRING },\n                      altitude: { type: Type.NUMBER },\n                      type: { type: Type.STRING, enum: [\"VALLEY\", \"SLOPE\", \"PEAK\", \"RIDGE\"] },\n                      description: { type: Type.STRING } // Added description field\n                    },\n                    required: [\"label\", \"altitude\", \"type\"]\n                  }\n                }\n              },\n              required: [\"source\", \"summary\", \"cloud_trap_potential\", \"elevation_profile\"]\n            },\n            dailyForecasts: {\n              type: Type.ARRAY,\n              items: {\n                type: Type.OBJECT,\n                properties: {\n                  date: { type: Type.STRING },\n                  score: { type: Type.NUMBER },\n                  status_code: { type: Type.STRING, enum: [\"STATIC\", \"FLOWING\", \"CLEAR\", \"FOG\", \"DISSIPATING\"] },\n                  status_text: { type: Type.STRING },\n                  technical_indices: { \n                    type: Type.OBJECT,\n                    properties: {\n                      LCL_base: { type: Type.STRING },\n                      FSI_score: { type: Type.NUMBER },\n                      cloud_top_estimated: { type: Type.STRING },\n                      wind_impact_level: { type: Type.STRING, enum: [\"Low\", \"Medium\", \"High\", \"Destructive\"] },\n                      moisture_type: { type: Type.STRING, enum: [\"Deep\", \"Shallow\"] }\n                    },\n                    required: [\"LCL_base\", \"FSI_score\", \"cloud_top_estimated\", \"wind_impact_level\", \"moisture_type\"]\n                  },\n                  weather_analysis: {\n                    type: Type.OBJECT,\n                    properties: {\n                      general: { type: Type.STRING },\n                      cloud_behavior: { type: Type.STRING }\n                    },\n                    required: [\"general\", \"cloud_behavior\"]\n                  },\n                  expert_advice: { type: Type.STRING },\n                  weather_summary: {\n                    type: Type.OBJECT,\n                    properties: {\n                      temp: { type: Type.STRING },\n                      humidity: { type: Type.STRING },\n                      wind: { type: Type.STRING }\n                    },\n                    required: [\"temp\", \"humidity\", \"wind\"]\n                  }\n                },\n                required: [\"date\", \"score\", \"status_code\", \"status_text\", \"technical_indices\", \"weather_analysis\", \"expert_advice\", \"weather_summary\"]\n              }\n            },\n            gearChecklist: { type: Type.ARRAY, items: { type: Type.STRING } }\n          },\n          required: [\"locationName\", \"dailyForecasts\", \"bestDays\", \"overallStrategy\", \"gearChecklist\", \"terrain_analysis\"]\n        }\n      }\n    });\n\n    if (response.text) {\n      const analysis = JSON.parse(response.text) as CloudAnalysis;\n      const sources = response.candidates?.[0]?.groundingMetadata?.groundingChunks\n        ?.map(chunk => chunk.web)\n        .filter((web): web is { title: string; uri: string } => !!web) || [];\n      \n      // 2. FORCE OVERWRITE: Double check consistency\n      if (matchedPreset && matchedPreset.elevation_profile) {\n        analysis.terrain_analysis.elevation_profile = matchedPreset.elevation_profile;\n        analysis.terrain_analysis.source = \'HARDCODED\';\n      }\n      \n      return { ...analysis, sources };\n    }\n    throw new Error(\"No response from AI\");\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(\"Gemini Analysis Error:\", error);\n    // Mock error data matching new structure\n    return {\n      locationName: data.locationName,\n      overallStrategy: \"Kh\303\264ng th\341\273\203 k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i \304\221\341\272\277n h\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng ph\303\242n t\303\255ch chuy\303\252n s\303\242u. Vui l\303\262ng th\341\273\255 l\341\272\241i.\",\n      bestDays: [],\n      dailyForecasts: [],\n      gearChecklist: [],\n      terrain_analysis: { source: \'RESEARCHED\', summary: \"\", cloud_trap_potential: \"Low\", elevation_profile: [] },\n      sources: []\n    };\n  }\n};\n"
    num_lines: 291
    num_bytes: 15937
  }
}
