  checkpoint {
    user_intent: "Cloud Analysis Module Update\n\nThe user\'s main goal is to update the cloud analysis module by implementing the \"Boundary Fluctuation Rule\" (Quy t\341\272\257c Ranh gi\341\273\233i M\341\272\267t M\303\242y). This involves:\n\n1.  **Calculating Altitude Difference:** Determining the difference ($\\Delta H$) between the user\'s current altitude and the predicted cloud top altitude.\n2.  **Implementing Boundary Logic:**\n    *   If $\\Delta H > 300m$ (Safe Zone), the cloud behavior is either static (above clouds) or zero visibility (below clouds).\n    *   If $\\Delta H \\le 200m$ (Fluctuating Zone), the cloud status needs to be updated.\n3.  **Updating Output Format:**\n    *   Add \"FLUCTUATING\" to the allowed `status_code` values.\n    *   Set `status_code` to \"FLUCTUATING\" or \"ROLLING\" when in the boundary zone.\n    *   Set `status_text` to \"M\303\242y d\303\242ng t\341\273\253ng l\341\273\233p / Dao \304\221\341\273\231ng li\303\252n t\341\273\245c\".\n    *   Provide a specific explanation for `cloud_behavior` describing the phenomenon.\n    *   Add specific `expert_advice` for the fluctuating zone, encouraging patience."
    intent_only: true
    included_step_index_end: 8
    conversation_log_uris: "file:///.gemini/antigravity/brain/.system_generated/logs/overview.txt"
    user_requests: "Here is the full initial file tree for the application:\n/.env.local\n/.gitignore\n/App.tsx\n/components/AnalysisResult.tsx\n/components/Header.tsx\n/components/InputForm.tsx\n/constants.ts\n/index.html\n/index.tsx\n/metadata.json\n/package.json\n/services/geminiService.ts\n/tsconfig.json\n/types.ts\n/vite.config.ts\n\nThe following dependencies are installed:\n@google/genai: ^1.34.0\nreact: ^19.2.3\nreact-dom: ^19.2.3\n\nThe following devDependencies are installed:\n@types/node: ^22.14.0\n@vitejs/plugin-react: ^5.0.0\ntypescript: ~5.8.2\nvite: ^6.2.0\n\nKey file contents:\n\n--- /App.tsx ---\n```typescript\n\nimport React, { useState } from \'react\';\nimport { Header } from \'./components/Header\';\nimport { InputForm } from \'./components/InputForm\';\nimport { AnalysisResult } from \'./components/AnalysisResult\';\nimport { CloudAnalysis, WeatherInput } from \'./types\';\nimport { analyzeWeatherData } from \'./services/geminiService\';\n\nconst App: React.FC = () => {\n  const [analysis, setAnalysis] = useState<CloudAnalysis | null>(null);\n  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(false);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (data: WeatherInput) => {\n    setIsLoading(true);\n    setError(null);\n    try {\n      const result = await analyzeWeatherData(data);\n      setAnalysis(result);\n    } catch (err) {\n      setError(\"C\303\263 l\341\273\227i x\341\272\243y ra trong qu\303\241 tr\303\254nh ph\303\242n t\303\255ch. Vui l\303\262ng ki\341\273\203m tra API Key ho\341\272\267c th\341\273\255 l\341\272\241i sau.\");\n      console.error(err);\n    } finally {\n      setIsLoading(false);\n    }\n  };\n\n  const handleReset = () => {\n    setAnalysis(null);\n    setError(null);\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 selection:bg-cyan-500 selection:text-white font-sans\">\n      {/* Background Ambience */}\n      <div className=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none\">\n        <div className=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1/2 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-900/10 to-transparent\"></div>\n        <div className=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-900/10 blur-[100px] rounded-full\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div className=\"relative z-10 container mx-auto px-4 pb-12\">\n        <Header />\n        \n        <main className=\"transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out\">\n          {error && (\n            <div className=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto bg-red-900/30 border border-red-500 text-red-200 p-4 rounded-lg mb-6 text-center\">\n              {error}\n            </div>\n          )}\n\n          {!analysis ? (\n            <div className=\"animate-fade-in-up\">\n              <InputForm onSubmit={handleSubmit} isLoading={isLoading} />\n            </div>\n          ) : (\n            <AnalysisResult result={analysis} onReset={handleReset} />\n          )}\n        </main>\n        \n        <footer className=\"mt-16 text-center text-slate-600 text-sm\">\n          <p>\302\251 2024 CloudHunter AI. D\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u mang t\303\255nh ch\341\272\245t tham kh\341\272\243o. Lu\303\264n ki\341\273\203m tra th\341\273\235i ti\341\272\277t th\341\273\261c t\341\272\277.</p>\n        </footer>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n\nexport default App;\n\n```\n\n--- /index.html ---\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"vi\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>CloudHunter AI - D\341\273\261 b\303\241o Bi\341\273\203n M\303\242y T\303\242y B\341\272\257c</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <style>\n    @import url(\'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700;900&display=swap\');\n    body {\n      font-family: \'Inter\', sans-serif;\n    }\n    .animate-fade-in {\n      animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-out forwards;\n    }\n    .animate-fade-in-up {\n      animation: fadeInUp 0.5s ease-out forwards;\n    }\n    @keyframes fadeIn {\n      from { opacity: 0; }\n      to { opacity: 1; }\n    }\n    @keyframes fadeInUp {\n      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n    }\n  </style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">\n{\n  \"imports\": {\n    \"@google/genai\": \"https://esm.sh/@google/genai@^1.34.0\",\n    \"react-dom/\": \"https://esm.sh/react-dom@^19.2.3/\",\n    \"react/\": \"https://esm.sh/react@^19.2.3/\",\n    \"react\": \"https://esm.sh/react@^19.2.3\"\n  }\n}\n</script>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/index.css\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-950\">\n  <div id=\"root\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"/index.tsx\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n```\n\n--- /metadata.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"CloudHunter AI\",\n  \"description\": \"Expert meteorological analysis for cloud hunting and trekking in Northwest Vietnam.\",\n  \"requestFramePermissions\": []\n}\n```\n\n--- /tsconfig.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"experimentalDecorators\": true,\n    \"useDefineForClassFields\": false,\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"lib\": [\n      \"ES2022\",\n      \"DOM\",\n      \"DOM.Iterable\"\n    ],\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"types\": [\n      \"node\"\n    ],\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"moduleDetection\": \"force\",\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\n        \"./*\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n--- /vite.config.ts ---\n```typescript\nimport path from \'path\';\nimport { defineConfig, loadEnv } from \'vite\';\nimport react from \'@vitejs/plugin-react\';\n\nexport default defineConfig(({ mode }) => {\n    const env = loadEnv(mode, \'.\', \'\');\n    return {\n      server: {\n        port: 3000,\n        host: \'0.0.0.0\',\n      },\n      plugins: [react()],\n      define: {\n        \'process.env.API_KEY\': JSON.stringify(env.GEMINI_API_KEY),\n        \'process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY\': JSON.stringify(env.GEMINI_API_KEY)\n      },\n      resolve: {\n        alias: {\n          \'@\': path.resolve(__dirname, \'.\'),\n        }\n      }\n    };\n});\n\n```"
    user_requests: "# MODULE 6: THE BOUNDARY FLUCTUATION RULE (QUY T\341\272\256C RANH GI\341\273\232I M\341\272\266T M\303\202Y)\n*M\341\273\245c \304\221\303\255ch: X\341\273\255 l\303\275 hi\341\273\207u \341\273\251ng \"m\303\242y d\303\242ng t\341\273\253ng l\341\273\233p\" do d\303\262ng th\304\203ng nhi\341\273\207t khi ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng \304\221\341\273\251ng qu\303\241 g\341\272\247n m\341\272\267t m\303\242y (B\303\240i h\341\273\215c th\341\273\261c \304\221\341\273\213a t\341\273\253 Homestay Y T\303\275 1900m).*\n\n**Thu\341\272\255t to\303\241n so s\303\241nh cao \304\221\341\273\231:**\nB\341\272\241n b\341\272\257t bu\341\273\231c ph\341\272\243i t\303\255nh \304\221\341\273\231 ch\303\252nh l\341\273\207ch ($\\Delta H$) gi\341\273\257a **\304\220\341\273\231 cao v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng \304\221ang \304\221\341\273\251ng** (VD: L\303\241n ngh\341\273\211 2100m, Homestay 1900m) v\303\240 **\304\220\341\273\231 cao m\341\272\267t m\303\242y d\341\273\261 ki\341\272\277n (Cloud Top)** t\303\255nh \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c \341\273\237 Module 4.\n\n1. **Tr\306\260\341\273\235ng h\341\273\243p An to\303\240n ($\\Delta H > 300m$):**\n   - N\341\272\277u *V\341\273\213 tr\303\255 > Cloud Top*: Ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng \304\221\341\273\251ng r\341\272\245t cao tr\303\252n m\303\242y -> Bi\341\273\203n m\303\242y t\304\251nh l\341\272\267ng tuy\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\221i, ph\341\272\263ng l\341\273\263 nh\306\260 th\341\272\243m b\303\264ng. Kh\303\264ng b\341\273\213 m\303\271.\n   - N\341\272\277u *V\341\273\213 tr\303\255 < Cloud Top*: Ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng ch\303\254m s\303\242u trong m\303\242y -> M\303\271 \304\221\341\272\267c qu\303\241nh, \306\260\341\273\233t \303\241t, t\341\272\247m nh\303\254n zero.\n\n2. **Tr\306\260\341\273\235ng h\341\273\243p Ranh gi\341\273\233i ($\\Delta H \\le 200m$): KHU V\341\273\260C DAO \304\220\341\273\230NG (FLUCTUATING ZONE)**\n   - *Logic:* T\341\272\241i m\303\251p ranh gi\341\273\233i ngh\341\273\213ch nhi\341\273\207t, m\303\242y kh\303\264ng \304\221\341\273\251ng im m\303\240 \"th\341\273\237\" theo d\303\262ng th\304\203ng nhi\341\273\207t (Thermal updrafts) ho\341\272\267c gi\303\263 thung l\305\251ng nh\341\272\271.\n   - *H\303\240nh \304\221\341\273\231ng b\341\272\257t bu\341\273\231c c\341\273\247a AI:* -> \304\220\341\273\225i `status_code` th\303\240nh **\"FLUCTUATING\"** ho\341\272\267c **\"ROLLING\"**.\n     -> \304\220\341\273\225i `status_text` th\303\240nh **\"M\303\242y d\303\242ng t\341\273\253ng l\341\273\233p / Dao \304\221\341\273\231ng li\303\252n t\341\273\245c\"**.\n     -> Trong `cloud_behavior`, ph\341\272\243i gi\341\272\243i th\303\255ch r\303\265 hi\341\273\207n t\306\260\341\273\243ng: \"B\341\272\241n \304\221ang \341\273\237 ngay ranh gi\341\273\233i m\341\272\267t m\303\242y. M\303\242y s\341\272\275 d\303\242ng l\303\252n t\341\273\253ng l\341\273\233p do d\303\262ng th\304\203ng nhi\341\273\207t. C\341\272\243nh quan s\341\272\275 thay \304\221\341\273\225i li\303\252n t\341\273\245c: l\303\272c quang \304\221\303\243ng m\303\242y d\306\260\341\273\233i ch\303\242n, l\303\272c gi\303\263 th\341\273\225i s\341\272\275 b\341\273\213 m\303\271 tr\303\271m ng\341\272\255p c\341\273\245c b\341\273\231.\"\n\n# UPDATE OUTPUT FORMAT (JSON SCHEMA)\nC\341\272\255p nh\341\272\255t c\303\241c gi\303\241 tr\341\273\213 cho ph\303\251p trong JSON:\n* `status_code`: B\341\273\225 sung th\303\252m \"FLUCTUATING\" (B\303\252n c\341\272\241nh STATIC, FLOWING, CLEAR, FOG).\n* `expert_advice`: N\341\272\277u r\306\241i v\303\240o tr\306\260\341\273\235ng h\341\273\243p Ranh gi\341\273\233i, h\303\243y khuy\303\252n ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng ki\303\252n nh\341\272\253n: \"\304\220\341\273\253ng v\341\273\231i th\341\272\245t v\341\273\215ng khi th\341\272\245y m\303\271. H\303\243y ki\303\252n nh\341\272\253n ch\341\273\235 nh\341\273\257ng c\306\241n gi\303\263 \304\221\341\272\251y m\303\271 \304\221i, b\341\272\241n s\341\272\275 ch\341\273\245p \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c kho\341\272\243nh kh\341\272\257c m\303\242y tr\303\240o l\303\252n t\341\272\255n m\341\272\267t c\341\273\261c k\341\273\263 huy\341\273\201n \341\272\243o.\""
    user_requests: "# MODULE 6: THE BOUNDARY FLUCTUATION RULE (QUY T\341\272\256C RANH GI\341\273\232I M\341\272\266T M\303\202Y)\n*M\341\273\245c \304\221\303\255ch: X\341\273\255 l\303\275 hi\341\273\207u \341\273\251ng \"m\303\242y d\303\242ng t\341\273\253ng l\341\273\233p\" do d\303\262ng th\304\203ng nhi\341\273\207t khi ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng \304\221\341\273\251ng qu\303\241 g\341\272\247n m\341\272\267t m\303\242y (B\303\240i h\341\273\215c th\341\273\261c \304\221\341\273\213a t\341\273\253 Homestay Y T\303\275 1900m).*\n\n**Thu\341\272\255t to\303\241n so s\303\241nh cao \304\221\341\273\231:**\nB\341\272\241n b\341\272\257t bu\341\273\231c ph\341\272\243i t\303\255nh \304\221\341\273\231 ch\303\252nh l\341\273\207ch ($\\Delta H$) gi\341\273\257a **\304\220\341\273\231 cao v\341\273\213 tr\303\255 ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng \304\221ang \304\221\341\273\251ng** (VD: L\303\241n ngh\341\273\211 2100m, Homestay 1900m) v\303\240 **\304\220\341\273\231 cao m\341\272\267t m\303\242y d\341\273\261 ki\341\272\277n (Cloud Top)** t\303\255nh \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c \341\273\237 Module 4.\n\n1. **Tr\306\260\341\273\235ng h\341\273\243p An to\303\240n ($\\Delta H > 300m$):**\n   - N\341\272\277u *V\341\273\213 tr\303\255 > Cloud Top*: Ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng \304\221\341\273\251ng r\341\272\245t cao tr\303\252n m\303\242y -> Bi\341\273\203n m\303\242y t\304\251nh l\341\272\267ng tuy\341\273\207t \304\221\341\273\221i, ph\341\272\263ng l\341\273\263 nh\306\260 th\341\272\243m b\303\264ng. Kh\303\264ng b\341\273\213 m\303\271.\n   - N\341\272\277u *V\341\273\213 tr\303\255 < Cloud Top*: Ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng ch\303\254m s\303\242u trong m\303\242y -> M\303\271 \304\221\341\272\267c qu\303\241nh, \306\260\341\273\233t \303\241t, t\341\272\247m nh\303\254n zero.\n\n2. **Tr\306\260\341\273\235ng h\341\273\243p Ranh gi\341\273\233i ($\\Delta H \\le 200m$): KHU V\341\273\260C DAO \304\220\341\273\230NG (FLUCTUATING ZONE)*