  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Input Strategy**\n\nI\'m now moving to replace the existing separate select and input elements in `InputForm.tsx` with a single input field. The goal is to integrate an autocomplete feature, offering suggestions for popular trekking spots and weather stations as the user types. This should streamline the user experience.\n\n\n**Implementing Autocomplete Feature**\n\nI\'m now integrating an autocomplete feature into the input field for a better user experience. My current plan involves removing the quick select dropdown and adapting the manual text input to become the primary input. I\'m adding state variables for suggestions and dropdown visibility. I\'ll implement `handleInputChange` to filter the peak data, using case-insensitive matching against both names and aliases. I\'ll also add a dropdown list below the input field and populate the input with the selected location on click, hiding the dropdown after.\n\n\n**Adapting Location Input**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the `handleInputChange` function. I\'ve updated it to filter a list of peak data, considering names, aliases, and provinces. This filtering is case-insensitive. After filtering, I\'m setting the suggestions state and displaying or hiding the suggestions dropdown. I\'ve also built out the `handleSuggestionClick` function, setting the input field\'s value to the selected peak\'s name and then hiding the suggestions dropdown. I\'ve verified the import of `PeakPreset` and `NORTHWEST_PEAKS`. I\'m removing the Quick Select dropdown to fully integrate the autocomplete functionality.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "99239fab-f37d-4c74-8634-0f4a445fb66d"
      name: "edit_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Instruction\":\"Replace the separate select and input fields with a single autocomplete input field that suggests locations from NORTHWEST_PEAKS as the user types.\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"import React, { useState, useRef, useEffect } from \'react\';\\nimport { WeatherInput, PeakPreset } from \'../types\';\\nimport { NORTHWEST_PEAKS } from \'../constants\';\\n\\ninterface InputFormProps {\\n  onSubmit: (data: WeatherInput) => void;\\n  isLoading: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport const InputForm: React.FC<InputFormProps> = ({ onSubmit, isLoading }) => {\\n  // Default range: Today to +3 days\\n  const today = new Date();\\n  const threeDaysLater = new Date(today);\\n  threeDaysLater.setDate(today.getDate() + 3);\\n\\n  const [formData, setFormData] = useState<WeatherInput>({\\n    locationName: \'\',\\n    startDate: today.toISOString().split(\'T\')[0],\\n    endDate: threeDaysLater.toISOString().split(\'T\')[0],\\n  });\\n\\n  const [suggestions, setSuggestions] = useState<PeakPreset[]>([]);\\n  const [showSuggestions, setShowSuggestions] = useState(false);\\n  const wrapperRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    // Click outside handler to close suggestions\\n    function handleClickOutside(event: MouseEvent) {\\n      if (wrapperRef.current && !wrapperRef.current.contains(event.target as Node)) {\\n        setShowSuggestions(false);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    document.addEventListener(\\\"mousedown\\\", handleClickOutside);\\n    return () => {\\n      document.removeEventListener(\\\"mousedown\\\", handleClickOutside);\\n    };\\n  }, [wrapperRef]);\\n\\n  const handleInputChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {\\n    const value = e.target.value;\\n    setFormData(prev => ({ ...prev, locationName: value }));\\n\\n    if (value.trim().length > 0) {\\n      const searchTerm = value.toLowerCase();\\n      const filtered = NORTHWEST_PEAKS.filter(peak => {\\n        const nameMatch = peak.name.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm);\\n        const aliasMatch = peak.aliases?.some(alias => alias.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm));\\n        const provinceMatch = peak.province.toLowerCase().includes(searchTerm);\\n        return nameMatch || aliasMatch || provinceMatch;\\n      });\\n      setSuggestions(filtered);\\n      setShowSuggestions(true);\\n    } else {\\n      setSuggestions([]);\\n      setShowSuggestions(false);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleSuggestionClick = (peak: PeakPreset) => {\\n    setFormData(prev => ({ ...prev, locationName: peak.name }));\\n    setShowSuggestions(false);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleDateChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {\\n    const { name, value } = e.target;\\n    setFormData(prev => ({ ...prev, [name]: value }));\\n  };\\n\\n  const isFormValid = \\n    formData.locationName.trim().length > 0 && \\n    formData.startDate <= formData.endDate;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-md p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 shadow-xl max-w-xl mx-auto\\\">\\n      <h2 className=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-6 flex items-center\\\">\\n        <svg className=\\\"w-6 h-6 mr-2\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\">\\n          <path strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\" strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\" strokeWidth={2} d=\\\"M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\\\" />\\n        </svg>\\n        Ph\303\242n t\303\255ch theo L\341\273\213ch tr\303\254nh\\n      </h2>\\n      \\n      <div className=\\\"space-y-6\\\">\\n        \\n        {/* Location Selection Area */}\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-3\\\" ref={wrapperRef}>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-slate-400 text-sm\\\">\304\220\341\273\213a \304\221i\341\273\203m s\304\203n m\303\242y (Location)</label>\\n            \\n            <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n                 <input\\n                    type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                    name=\\\"locationName\\\"\\n                    value={formData.locationName}\\n                    onChange={handleInputChange}\\n                    onFocus={() => {\\n                        if (formData.locationName.trim().length > 0 && suggestions.length > 0) {\\n                            setShowSuggestions(true);\\n                        }\\n                    }}\\n                    placeholder=\\\"Nh\341\272\255p \304\221\341\273\213a \304\221i\341\273\203m (VD: T\303\240 X\303\271a, Y T\303\275, Fansipan...)\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-600 rounded-lg p-4 text-slate-100 text-lg placeholder-slate-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none transition-all\\\"\\n                    autoComplete=\\\"off\\\"\\n                 />\\n                 <div className=\\\"absolute right-3 top-4 text-slate-500 pointer-events-none\\\">\\n                    <svg className=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\" strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\" strokeWidth={2} d=\\\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z\\\" /></svg>\\n                 </div>\\n\\n                 {/* Autocomplete Dropdown */}\\n                 {showSuggestions && suggestions.length > 0 && (\\n                    <div className=\\\"absolute z-50 w-full mt-1 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg shadow-2xl max-h-60 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar\\\">\\n                        {suggestions.map((peak, index) => (\\n                            <div \\n                                key={index}\\n                                onClick={() => handleSuggestionClick(peak)}\\n                                className=\\\"p-3 hover:bg-slate-800 cursor-pointer border-b border-slate-800 last:border-0 transition-colors group\\\"\\n                            >\\n                                <div className=\\\"flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n                                    <span className=\\\"font-bold text-slate-200 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors\\\">{peak.name}</span>\\n                                    <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 bg-slate-800 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-slate-700\\\">{peak.altitude}m</span>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                                    <span className=\\\"text-cyan-600 font-semibold\\\">{peak.province}</span>\\n                                    {peak.aliases && peak.aliases.length > 0 && (\\n                                        <span className=\\\"truncate max-w-[200px] opacity-70\\\">\\n                                            \342\200\242 {peak.aliases.slice(0, 2).join(\', \')}\\n                                        </span>\\n                                    )}\\n                                </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                        ))}\\n                    </div>\\n                 )}\\n            </div>\\n            \\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 italic\\\">\\n               * H\341\273\227 tr\341\273\243 t\303\254m ki\341\272\277m theo t\303\252n, t\341\273\211nh th\303\240nh ho\341\272\267c t\303\252n g\341\273\215i kh\303\241c (VD: \\\"Kh\341\273\247ng Long\\\", \\\"N\303\263c nh\303\240 \304\220\303\264ng D\306\260\306\241ng\\\").\\n            </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Date Range Input */}\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-slate-400 text-sm mb-2\\\">T\341\273\253 ng\303\240y (Start)</label>\\n            <input \\n              type=\\\"date\\\" \\n              name=\\\"startDate\\\"\\n              value={formData.startDate}\\n              onChange={handleDateChange}\\n              className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-600 rounded-lg p-3 text-slate-100 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none\\\"\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-slate-400 text-sm mb-2\\\">\304\220\341\272\277n ng\303\240y (End)</label>\\n            <input \\n              type=\\\"date\\\" \\n              name=\\\"endDate\\\"\\n              value={formData.endDate}\\n              onChange={handleDateChange}\\n              min={formData.startDate}\\n              className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-600 rounded-lg p-3 text-slate-100 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none\\\"\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"mt-8\\\">\\n        <button \\n          onClick={() => onSubmit(formData)}\\n          disabled={isLoading || !isFormValid}\\n          className={`w-full py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg tracking-wide transition-all shadow-lg flex justify-center items-center\\n            ${isLoading || !isFormValid\\n              ? \'bg-slate-700 text-slate-400 cursor-not-allowed\' \\n              : \'bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-blue-600 hover:from-cyan-500 hover:to-blue-500 text-white shadow-cyan-900/20\'\\n            }`}\\n        >\\n          {isLoading ? (\\n            <>\\n              <svg className=\\\"animate-spin -ml-1 mr-3 h-5 w-5 text-white\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\">\\n                <circle className=\\\"opacity-25\\\" cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"10\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"4\\\"></circle>\\n                <path className=\\\"opacity-75\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" d=\\\"M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4zm2 5.291A7.962 7.962 0 014 12H0c0 3.042 1.135 5.824 3 7.938l3-2.647z\\\"></path>\\n              </svg>\\n              Thinking Mode & Ph\303\242n t\303\255ch s\303\242u...\\n            </>\\n          ) : (\\n            <>\\n              <svg className=\\\"w-5 h-5 mr-2\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\" strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\" strokeWidth={2} d=\\\"M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z\\\" /></svg>\\n              PH\303\202N T\303\215CH L\341\273\212CH TR\303\214NH\\n            </>\\n          )}\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\", \"TargetContent\":\"import React, { useState, useMemo } from \'react\';\\nimport { WeatherInput, PeakPreset } from \'../types\';\\nimport { NORTHWEST_PEAKS } from \'../constants\';\\n\\ninterface InputFormProps {\\n  onSubmit: (data: WeatherInput) => void;\\n  isLoading: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport const InputForm: React.FC<InputFormProps> = ({ onSubmit, isLoading }) => {\\n  // Default range: Today to +3 days\\n  const today = new Date();\\n  const threeDaysLater = new Date(today);\\n  threeDaysLater.setDate(today.getDate() + 3);\\n\\n  const [formData, setFormData] = useState<WeatherInput>({\\n    locationName: \'\',\\n    startDate: today.toISOString().split(\'T\')[0],\\n    endDate: threeDaysLater.toISOString().split(\'T\')[0],\\n  });\\n\\n  const handleChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement | HTMLSelectElement>) => {\\n    const { name, value } = e.target;\\n    setFormData(prev => ({ ...prev, [name]: value }));\\n  };\\n\\n  // Handler for the \\\"Quick Select\\\" dropdown\\n  const handlePresetChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLSelectElement>) => {\\n    const value = e.target.value;\\n    if (value) {\\n        setFormData(prev => ({ ...prev, locationName: value }));\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const isFormValid = \\n    formData.locationName.trim().length > 0 && \\n    formData.startDate <= formData.endDate;\\n\\n  // Group peaks by province\\n  const groupedPeaks = useMemo(() => {\\n    const groups: { [key: string]: PeakPreset[] } = {};\\n    NORTHWEST_PEAKS.forEach(peak => {\\n      if (!groups[peak.province]) {\\n        groups[peak.province] = [];\\n      }\\n      groups[peak.province].push(peak);\\n    });\\n    return groups;\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-md p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 shadow-xl max-w-xl mx-auto\\\">\\n      <h2 className=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-6 flex items-center\\\">\\n        <svg className=\\\"w-6 h-6 mr-2\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\">\\n          <path strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\" strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\" strokeWidth={2} d=\\\"M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\\\" />\\n        </svg>\\n        Ph\303\242n t\303\255ch theo L\341\273\213ch tr\303\254nh\\n      </h2>\\n      \\n      <div className=\\\"space-y-6\\\">\\n        \\n        {/* Location Selection Area */}\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-3\\\">\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-slate-400 text-sm\\\">\304\220\341\273\213a \304\221i\341\273\203m s\304\203n m\303\242y (Location)</label>\\n            \\n            {/* 1. Quick Select Dropdown (Helper) */}\\n            <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n                <select\\n                    onChange={handlePresetChange}\\n                    className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-t-lg p-3 text-sm text-cyan-500 font-medium focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none appearance-none cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors\\\"\\n                    defaultValue=\\\"\\\"\\n                >\\n                    <option value=\\\"\\\" disabled>\342\234\250 Ch\341\273\215n nhanh \304\221i\341\273\203m n\341\273\225i ti\341\272\277ng (G\341\273\243i \303\275)...</option>\\n                    {Object.keys(groupedPeaks).map(province => (\\n                        <optgroup key={province} label={`--- ${province} ---`} className=\\\"text-slate-400 font-bold bg-slate-900\\\">\\n                        {groupedPeaks[province].map(peak => (\\n                            <option key={peak.name} value={`${peak.name} (Alt: ${peak.altitude}m)`} className=\\\"text-slate-100 font-normal\\\">\\n                            {peak.name} ({peak.altitude}m)\\n                            </option>\\n                        ))}\\n                        </optgroup>\\n                    ))}\\n                </select>\\n                <div className=\\\"absolute inset-y-0 right-0 flex items-center px-3 pointer-events-none text-cyan-600\\\">\\n                    <svg className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\" strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\" strokeWidth={2} d=\\\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\\\" /></svg>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* 2. Manual Text Input (Main Source) */}\\n            <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n                 <input\\n                    type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                    name=\\\"locationName\\\"\\n                    value={formData.locationName}\\n                    onChange={handleChange}\\n                    placeholder=\\\"Ho\341\272\267c nh\341\272\255p \304\221\341\273\213a \304\221i\341\273\203m b\341\272\245t k\341\273\263 (VD: \304\220\341\273\223i \304\220a Ph\303\272, \304\220\303\240 L\341\272\241t...)\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-600 border-t-0 rounded-b-lg p-4 text-slate-100 text-lg placeholder-slate-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none transition-all\\\"\\n                 />\\n                 <div className=\\\"absolute right-3 top-4 text-slate-500\\\">\\n                    <svg className=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\" strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\" strokeWidth={2} d=\\\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\\\" /><path strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\" strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\" strokeWidth={2} d=\\\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\\\" /></svg>\\n                 </div>\\n            </div>\\n            \\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 italic\\\">\\n               * N\341\272\277u nh\341\272\255p th\341\273\247 c\303\264ng, AI s\341\272\275 t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng t\303\254m ki\341\272\277m th\303\264ng tin \304\221\341\273\213a h\303\254nh v\303\240 \304\221\341\273\231 cao c\341\273\247a \304\221\341\273\213a \304\221i\341\273\203m \304\221\303\263.\\n            </p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Date Range Input */}\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-slate-400 text-sm mb-2\\\">T\341\273\253 ng\303\240y (Start)</label>\\n            <input \\n              type=\\\"date\\\" \\n              name=\\\"startDate\\\"\\n              value={formData.startDate}\\n              onChange={handleChange}\\n              className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-600 rounded-lg p-3 text-slate-100 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none\\\"\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <label className=\\\"block text-slate-400 text-sm mb-2\\\">\304\220\341\272\277n ng\303\240y (End)</label>\\n            <input \\n              type=\\\"date\\\" \\n              name=\\\"endDate\\\"\\n              value={formData.endDate}\\n              onChange={handleChange}\\n              min={formData.startDate}\\n              className=\\\"w-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-600 rounded-lg p-3 text-slate-100 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none\\\"\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"mt-8\\\">\\n        <button \\n          onClick={() => onSubmit(formData)}\\n          disabled={isLoading || !isFormValid}\\n          className={`w-full py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg tracking-wide transition-all shadow-lg flex justify-center items-center\\n            ${isLoading || !isFormValid\\n              ? \'bg-slate-700 text-slate-400 cursor-not-allowed\' \\n              : \'bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-blue-600 hover:from-cyan-500 hover:to-blue-500 text-white shadow-cyan-900/20\'\\n            }`}\\n        >\\n          {isLoading ? (\\n            <>\\n              <svg className=\\\"animate-spin -ml-1 mr-3 h-5 w-5 text-white\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\">\\n                <circle className=\\\"opacity-25\\\" cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"10\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"4\\\"></circle>\\n                <path className=\\\"opacity-75\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" d=\\\"M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4zm2 5.291A7.962 7.962 0 014 12H0c0 3.042 1.135 5.824 3 7.938l3-2.647z\\\"></path>\\n              </svg>\\n              Thinking Mode & Ph\303\242n t\303\255ch s\303\242u...\\n            </>\\n          ) : (\\n            <>\\n              <svg className=\\\"w-5 h-5 mr-2\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\" strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\" strokeWidth={2} d=\\\"M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z\\\" /></svg>\\n              PH\303\202N T\303\215CH L\341\273\212CH TR\303\214NH\\n            </>\\n          )}\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\", \"TargetFile\":\"/components/InputForm.tsx\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
    }
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 47
